 checks\nL47: accuracyRate  | Double  | Accuracy rate\nL48:   * Csv\nL49:   * Json\nL50:   * Json Lines\nL51: \nL52:     `alertType,alertCount,sampleSize,falsePositiveCount,accuracyRate\nL53:     GLOVE,95,1,1,0.0\nL54:     STATIC_DELIMITATION_AREA,161,4,2,0.34\nL55:     `\nL56: \nL57:     `[\nL58:     {\nL59:       \"alertType\": \"GLOVE\",\nL60:       \"alertCount\": 95,\nL61:       \"sampleSize\": 1,\nL62:       \"falsePositiveCount\": 1,\nL63:       \"accuracyRate\": 0.0\nL64:     },\nL65:     {\nL66:       \"alertType\": \"STATIC_DELIMITATION_AREA\",\nL67:       \"alertCount\": 161,\nL68:       \"sampleSize\": 4,\nL69:       \"falsePositiveCount\": 2,\nL70:       \"accuracyRate\": 0.34\nL71:     }\nL72:     ]\nL73:     `\nL74: \nL75:     `{\"alertType\": \"GLOVE\", \"alertCount\": 95, \"sampleSize\": 1, \"falsePositiveCount\": 1, \"accuracyRate\": 0.0}\nL76:     {\"alertType\": \"STATIC_DELIMITATION_AREA\", \"alertCount\": 161, \"sampleSize\": 4, \"falsePositiveCount\": 2, \"accuracyRate\": 0.34}\nL77:     `\nL78: * * *\nL79: \nL80: 【8†Previous Connectivity】【10†Next Ergonomics】\nL81: \nL82:   * 【14†Export accuracy of use cases】\nL83: \nL84: Docs\nL85: \nL86:   * 【1†Usage】\nL87: \nL88: Social\nL89: \nL90:   * 【18†Linkedin†linkedin.com】\nL91:   * 【19†Twitter†twitter.com】\nL92:   * 【20†GitHub†github.com】\nL93: \nL94: Copyright © 2026 Intenseye Inc.\n"
